.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
doc/api/
*.iml
_*
.*
examples/
# The studio demo's recording (`app/demo/fixture/`): a fixture of the
# studio's own tests and web page, never of a consumer's install. It grows
# with every plugin recorded, and nothing in the archive reads it.
app/demo/

# `docs/` is the repo's own tree: 4 MB of design specs that produced the code,
# plus the generated capability reference. The README links it by relative path
# and `repository:` above is what makes those links resolve — to GitHub, where
# it is readable — so none of it has to ride along in an archive somebody
# downloads to compile against.
docs/

# Scratch space for unwritten ideas. `.gitignore` says so too, but a
# `.pubignore` replaces `.gitignore` wholesale rather than adding to it.
doc/ideas/
